// The offload park (SL:coroutines A3c): it records no deadline and the job's
// completion word from `__saw_exec_offload_park`, then reads the job's
// completion pipe and arms the reactor on it through the descriptor funnel,
// `__saw_exec_io_register`. `offload_wait` is the lane's addition to
// `std.task` (compiler/tests/coro/README.md, "The lane").
import std.task.{offload_wait}

func main() {
    offload_wait(7)
}
